  "title": "Corrective Action Audit Checklist Form",
  "subtitle": "Set the corrective action audit criteria and sample, test objective evidence, write precise findings, assign responses, verify follow-up, and close the audit.",
  "description": "An evidence-led corrective action audit checklist form for evaluating whether the root-cause and recurrence-prevention action is implemented and maintained, with explicit criteria, traceable samples, conformity evidence, requirement-based findings, response ownership, and verification.",
  "use_case": "Use for a scheduled, follow-up, triggered, or layered audit of the root-cause and recurrence-prevention action when conclusions must remain bounded to a documented population and evidence sample.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
